<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/logo/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/images/logo/favicon-16.png">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/logo/favicon.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/images/logo/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= pageTitle %></title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=a4c169302152">
</head>
<body data-loggedin="false">
  <div class="particles" id="particles"></div>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

  <div class="page-wrap" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 60px; color: var(--text);">
    <h1 style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; color: var(--lavender-light); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">Return & Refund Policy</h1>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">At <strong>Samadhan</strong>, we take pride in delivering high-quality, authentic spiritual products. To maintain hygiene and quality standards, we follow a strict return policy.</p>

      <h3 style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;">1. Eligibility for Returns</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 10px;">We do not offer returns or exchanges for a "change of mind" or if you simply do not like the product. <strong>Returns or replacements will ONLY be accepted under the following conditions:</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li>The product delivered to you is completely damaged or broken upon arrival.</li>
        <li>You received the wrong product (different from what you originally ordered).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;">2. How to Request a Return or Replacement</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 10px;">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item, you must inform us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of receiving the delivery. Please follow these steps:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Mandatory:</strong> Take a clear unboxing video from start to finish while opening the sealed package, clearly showing the damage or the wrong item.</li>
        <li>Send the unboxing video, pictures of the product, and your Order ID to our email at support@samadhanstore.com.</li>
        <li>Once our team reviews and approves your request, we will arrange for a free replacement or initiate a return.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;">3. Refunds Process</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">If a replacement is not available, we will issue a full refund. For online payments, the refund will be credited back to your original payment method within <strong>5-7 business days</strong>. For Cash on Delivery (COD) orders, you will need to provide your Bank Account details or UPI ID to receive the refund amount.</p>

      <h3 style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;">4. Contact Us</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 10px;">To raise an issue regarding your delivery, please contact our support team:</p>
      <p style="color: var(--lavender-light);">
        <strong>Email:</strong> support@samadhanstore.com<br>
        <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-8860811457
      </p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);"><em>Last updated: April 2026</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>